<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>{% if Target.PrimaryField %}{{ Target.PrimaryField }} | {% elsif Target.Label %}{{ Target.Label }} | {% elsif Target.Title and Target.Title != "Tellmarsh & Penhallow CPAs" %}{{ Target.Title }} | {% endif %}Tellmarsh & Penhallow CPAs</title>
<meta name="description" content="{% if Target.PublishedContent.summary %}{{ Target.PublishedContent.summary | strip_html | escape }}{% else %}Tellmarsh & Penhallow CPAs (fictional): tax returns, monthly bookkeeping, payroll, nonprofit 990s and planning in Merrow Bend, with a tax-year deadline almanac. An accounting firm website built on Raytha, a self-hosted, open-source .NET CMS for CPA firms, with a members-only client portal and staff room.{% endif %}">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,400;6..72,500;6..72,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><style>
:root{--paper:#f5f1e8;--card:#fffdf8;--ink:#17213a;--ink2:#4b5470;--rule:#ddd5c4;--q1:#2c6e74;--q2:#5f8a3a;--q3:#c99227;--q4:#b4502e;--red:#c8402a;--soft:#ece5d6}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:400 17px/1.6 "Instrument Sans",system-ui,sans-serif}
a{color:var(--q1)}a:hover{color:var(--q4)}img{max-width:100%;display:block}
h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:"Newsreader",Georgia,serif;font-weight:500;line-height:1.1;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.015em}
h1{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,4.6vw,3.9rem)}h2{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,2.9vw,2.5rem)}h3{font-size:1.32rem}
p{margin:0 0 1em}.w{max-width:1260px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px}.w.narrow{max-width:760px}
.mono,.kick{font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",ui-monospace,monospace}.small{font-size:.92rem}
.skip{position:absolute;left:-999px}.skip:focus{left:8px;top:8px;background:#fff;padding:8px;z-index:9}
.muted{color:var(--ink2)}.kick{font-weight:600;font-size:.76rem;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--q4);margin:0 0 14px}
.top{background:var(--ink);color:#c9cfdd;font-size:.84rem}.top .w{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:40px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.top .fict{font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;font-size:.76rem}.top .tr{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px}.top a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none}.top a:hover{text-decoration:underline;color:#fff}.top b{color:#fff}
.top input{background:#232f4d;border:1px solid #3a4768;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 14px;font:inherit;width:250px}.top input::placeholder{color:#9aa4bd}
.hdr{background:var(--card);position:relative}.hdr:after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:5px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--q1) 0 25%,var(--q2) 25% 50%,var(--q3) 50% 75%,var(--q4) 75%)}
.hdr .w{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding-top:20px;padding-bottom:25px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}.brand b{display:block;font:500 1.6rem/1.05 "Newsreader",Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.01em}.brand b i{color:var(--q4)}
.brand small{display:block;font:500 .7rem/1.3 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;color:var(--ink2);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:5px}
.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}.nav ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.nav ul a{display:block;padding:8px 10px;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;font-weight:500;border-radius:6px;position:relative}
.nav ul a:before{content:"";display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:2px;background:var(--q1)}
.nav li:nth-child(2) a:before{background:var(--q2)}.nav li:nth-child(3) a:before{background:var(--q3)}.nav li:nth-child(4) a:before{background:var(--q4)}.nav li:nth-child(5) a:before{background:var(--ink)}
.nav ul a:hover{background:var(--soft);color:var(--ink)}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:999px;padding:13px 22px;font:600 1rem/1 "Instrument Sans",sans-serif;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer}
.btn:hover{background:var(--q4);color:#fff}.btn.line{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1.5px var(--ink)}.btn.line:hover{background:var(--ink);color:#fff}.btn.sm{padding:10px 16px;font-size:.92rem}
.cta{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:26px}
.sec{padding:80px 0}.sec.tight{padding:46px 0}.shead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:24px;margin-bottom:34px;flex-wrap:wrap}.shead p{max-width:640px;margin:12px 0 0;color:var(--ink2)}
.chip{display:inline-block;font:500 .72rem/1 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;letter-spacing:.04em;padding:5px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--soft);color:var(--ink);margin-right:6px;white-space:nowrap}
.chip.f-individuals{background:#dcebea;color:#1d5156}.chip.f-business{background:#f3ddd3;color:#8a3a20}.chip.f-payroll{background:#f4e6c7;color:#7a5610}.chip.f-nonprofit{background:#e1ead3;color:#3f5d24}.chip.f-everyone{background:#e2e4ec}
.chip.lock{background:#17213a;color:#fff}.chip.staff{background:var(--q4);color:#fff}
/* hero + dial */
.hero{padding:58px 0 70px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 78% 46%,#fffdf8 0,#fffdf8 22%,transparent 60%)}.hero .g{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr minmax(0,560px);gap:60px;align-items:center}
.hero .lede{font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--ink2);max-width:540px;margin-top:22px}
.hero h1 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--q4)}
.office{display:flex;gap:0;margin-top:28px;border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:12px;background:var(--card);max-width:560px;overflow:hidden}.office div{padding:12px 16px;border-right:1px solid var(--rule);flex:1}.office div:last-child{border:0}
.office small{display:block;font:500 .68rem/1.2 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink2);margin-bottom:4px}.office b{font-weight:600;font-size:.96rem}
.dialwrap{position:relative}
.dial{position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;container-type:inline-size}
.dial .ring{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;filter:drop-shadow(0 24px 40px rgba(23,33,58,.16))}
.dial .ml{font:600 15px "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;fill:#fff;letter-spacing:.06em}.dial .ql{font:500 26px "Newsreader",serif;opacity:.55}
.pin{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:0;height:0;transform:rotate(var(--a)) translateY(calc(-1 * var(--r)));z-index:2}
.pin i{position:absolute;width:15px;height:15px;left:-7.5px;top:-7.5px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:3px solid var(--ink);box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.3);transition:transform .15s}
.pin.past i{background:#d9d3c5;border-color:#8b8a86}.pin:hover i{transform:scale(1.5)}
.pin.on i{width:24px;height:24px;left:-12px;top:-12px;background:var(--red);border:4px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(200,64,42,.3),0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.35);animation:pulse 2.2s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(200,64,42,.3),0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 12px rgba(200,64,42,0),0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}}
.hand{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:4px;margin-left:-2px;height:40cqw;background:linear-gradient(var(--ink) 0 60%,transparent);transform-origin:50% 0;transform:rotate(calc(var(--t) + 180deg));border-radius:2px;z-index:1}
.hub{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:14px;height:14px;margin:-7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ink);z-index:3}
.face{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:46cqw;text-align:center;z-index:4;pointer-events:none}
.face a{pointer-events:auto}
.face small{display:block;font:600 2.3cqw/1.2 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--q4);text-transform:uppercase}
.face .n{display:block;font:500 17cqw/0.9 "Newsreader",serif;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:1.6cqw 0 .4cqw;color:var(--ink);background:rgba(255,253,248,.9);border-radius:12px}
.face .u{display:block;font:500 2.6cqw/1.2 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;color:var(--ink2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em}
.face b{display:block;font:500 3.5cqw/1.15 "Newsreader",serif;margin-top:2cqw}.face b a{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none}.face b a:hover{color:var(--q4)}
.face .dt{display:inline-block;margin-top:1.4cqw;font:600 2.3cqw/1 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:1cqw 1.6cqw;border-radius:99px}
.today-tag{position:absolute;right:0;bottom:4%;font:500 .74rem/1.3 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;color:var(--ink2);text-align:right}.today-tag b{color:var(--ink);font-size:.95rem}
.legend{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;margin-top:10px;font:500 .74rem/1 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;color:var(--ink2)}.legend span:before{content:"";display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:6px;vertical-align:-1px;border:2px solid var(--ink);background:#fff}.legend .td:before{width:16px;height:3px;border:0;border-radius:2px;background:var(--ink);vertical-align:3px}.legend .nx:before{background:var(--red);border-color:var(--red)}.legend .ps:before{background:#d9d3c5;border-color:#8b8a86}
/* upcoming tear-off tiles */
.upnext{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:46px 0 52px}.upnext .shead h2{color:#fff}.upnext .shead p{color:#b8c0d4}.upnext .kick{color:#f0b59f}
.tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:16px}
.tile{display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -14px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}
.tile .mh{background:var(--c);color:#fff;font:600 .78rem/1 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;letter-spacing:.14em;padding:10px 14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
.tile .d{font:500 4rem/1 "Newsreader",serif;padding:14px 14px 0;letter-spacing:-.03em}
.tile b{font:500 1.06rem/1.25 "Newsreader",serif;padding:8px 14px 0;display:block}.tile small{padding:6px 14px 14px;color:var(--ink2);font-size:.85rem;display:block;margin-top:auto}
.tile .in{position:absolute;right:12px;top:44px;font:600 .72rem/1 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;background:var(--soft);padding:5px 8px;border-radius:99px}.tile:first-child .in{background:var(--red);color:#fff}
.tile:hover{transform:translateY(-3px)}.tile{transition:transform .15s}
.tile:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:34px;border-top:2px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.55)}
/* quarters band */
.qband{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--rule)}
.qband>div{padding:26px 24px 28px;background:var(--card);border-top:6px solid var(--c);position:relative}.qband>div+div{border-left:1px solid var(--rule)}
.qband .now{background:#fff;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px var(--c)}.qband .now:after{content:"YOU ARE HERE";position:absolute;right:14px;top:-14px;font:600 .66rem/1 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;background:var(--c);color:#fff;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:99px}
.qband h3{font-size:1.5rem}.qband .qn{font:600 .76rem/1 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--c);margin-bottom:10px;display:block}.qband ul{margin:12px 0 0;padding-left:18px;color:var(--ink2);font-size:.95rem}
/* service cards (engagement tags) */
.svcs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px}
.svc{display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:14px;padding:22px 22px 20px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);position:relative;transition:border-color .15s,transform .15s}
.svc:hover{border-color:var(--ink);transform:translateY(-2px);color:var(--ink)}
.svc .fee{font:500 2rem/1 "Newsreader",serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:14px 0 4px}.svc .fee small{font:500 .7rem/1 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;display:block;color:var(--ink2);margin-bottom:6px;text-transform:uppercase}
.svc .chip{align-self:flex-start}.svc h3{font-size:1.25rem;margin-top:10px}.svc p{color:var(--ink2);font-size:.95rem;margin:10px 0 14px}.svc .ft{margin-top:auto;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px dashed var(--rule);font:500 .76rem/1.4 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;color:var(--ink2)}
.svc .hole{position:absolute;right:18px;top:18px;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--paper);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.25)}
/* industries */
.inds{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px}
.ind{background:var(--card);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--rule);display:flex;flex-direction:column}.ind:hover{border-color:var(--ink);color:var(--ink)}
.ind .bd{padding:18px 22px 22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:18px;align-items:start}.ind .st{font:500 2.6rem/1 "Newsreader",serif;color:var(--c);letter-spacing:-.03em;min-width:76px;white-space:nowrap}.ind .st small{display:block;font:500 .66rem/1.25 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--ink2);margin-top:6px;text-transform:uppercase}
.ind h3{font-size:1.25rem}.ind p{margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--ink2);font-size:.95rem}
/* records chart */
.keep{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:16px;padding:26px 28px}
.axis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,300px) 1fr minmax(0,170px);gap:18px;font:500 .7rem/1 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;color:var(--ink2);padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}
.axis .sc{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
.krow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,300px) 1fr minmax(0,170px);gap:18px;align-items:center;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--rule);text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}.krow:hover{background:#fff}
.krow .bar{height:16px;border-radius:99px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0 calc(10% - 1px),rgba(23,33,58,.12) calc(10% - 1px) 10%);position:relative}
.krow .bar i{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;border-radius:99px;background:var(--c,var(--q1))}
.krow .bar i.perm{background:repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg,var(--c) 0 8px,color-mix(in srgb,var(--c) 70%,#fff) 8px 16px)}
.krow .lb{font:600 .82rem/1.2 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;text-align:right}.krow b{font-weight:600}.krow small{display:block;color:var(--ink2);font-size:.85rem;margin-top:2px}
/* people */
.ppl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:16px}.ppl.big{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:26px}
.person{text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);text-align:center}.person img{border-radius:50%;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover;box-shadow:0 0 0 5px var(--card),0 0 0 6px var(--rule);transition:transform .2s}.person:hover img{transform:rotate(-8deg)}
.person b{display:block;font:500 1.08rem/1.2 "Newsreader",serif;margin-top:14px}.person small{display:block;color:var(--ink2);font-size:.84rem}.person .cr{display:inline-block;font:600 .68rem/1 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-radius:99px;padding:4px 8px;margin-top:8px}
.ppl.big .person{text-align:left;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:16px;padding:20px}.ppl.big .person img{width:110px}.ppl.big .person p{color:var(--ink2);font-size:.92rem;margin:10px 0 0}
/* notes */
.nlist{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px}.nitem{text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}.nitem img{border-radius:12px;aspect-ratio:16/10;object-fit:cover;width:100%}
.nitem small{display:block;font:500 .74rem/1.3 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;color:var(--q4);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:14px 0 6px}.nitem b{display:block;font:500 1.35rem/1.2 "Newsreader",serif}.nitem span{display:block;margin-top:8px;color:var(--ink2);font-size:.95rem}.nitem:hover b{color:var(--q4)}
/* portal band */
.band{background:var(--q1);color:#fff;padding:56px 0}.band .w{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:40px;align-items:center}.band h2{color:#fff}.band p{color:#d6e8e7;font-size:1.08rem}
.band .btn{background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}.band .btn:hover{background:var(--q3)}
.band ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:10px}.band li{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;font-size:.98rem}.band li b{font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.08em;margin-right:8px;color:#ffe2a8}
/* page heads */
.phead{padding:46px 0 40px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);background:var(--card)}.phead .lede{font-size:1.18rem;color:var(--ink2);max-width:760px;margin-top:16px}
.crumbs{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 22px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;font:500 .78rem/1 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;color:var(--ink2)}.crumbs li+li:before{content:"/";margin-right:8px;color:var(--rule)}.crumbs a{color:var(--ink2)}
.filters{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px}.filters a{font:500 .8rem/1 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;padding:9px 13px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid var(--rule);text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper)}.filters a.on,.filters a:hover{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-color:var(--ink)}
/* almanac */
.alm{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px}
.mo{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;min-height:210px}
.mo .mh{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:4px solid var(--c)}.mo .mh h3{font-size:1.35rem}.mo .mh span{font:600 .68rem/1 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--c)}
.mo.now{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--c),0 20px 40px -24px rgba(23,33,58,.5)}.mo.now .mh{background:var(--c);color:#fff}.mo.now .mh span{color:#fff}
.mo ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:6px 0}.mo li a{display:grid;grid-template-columns:44px 1fr;gap:10px;padding:9px 16px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}.mo li a:hover{background:var(--paper)}
.mo .dd{font:500 1.7rem/1 "Newsreader",serif;color:var(--c)}.mo li b{display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:.94rem;line-height:1.3}.mo li small{display:block;color:var(--ink2);font:500 .72rem/1.35 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;margin-top:3px}
.mo li.past b{text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-color:rgba(23,33,58,.45);color:var(--ink2)}.mo li.past .dd{color:#a39f95}
.mo li.nx a{background:#fff3ef}.mo li.nx small{color:var(--red);font-weight:600}.mo .none{padding:14px 16px;color:var(--ink2);font-size:.9rem}
.nextbar{display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 24px;margin-top:26px;flex-wrap:wrap}.nextbar .n{font:500 3rem/1 "Newsreader",serif}.nextbar a{color:#fff}.nextbar small{font:500 .74rem/1.2 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#f0b59f;display:block}
/* detail layouts */
.dg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,380px);gap:52px;align-items:start}
.prose{font-size:1.08rem}.prose h2{margin:0 0 16px}.prose ul{padding-left:22px}.prose li{margin:6px 0}
.panel{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:14px;padding:22px 24px}
.memo{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:4px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:0 14px 34px -22px rgba(23,33,58,.5);position:relative;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0 46px,#f1c9bd 46px 47px,transparent 47px)}
.memo .mh{font:600 .74rem/1 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--q4);margin:0 0 14px;padding-left:34px}.memo>p,.memo>dl,.memo>ul{padding-left:34px}
.memo.login{background-image:none;padding:30px}.memo.login label{display:block;font:600 .8rem/1 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;letter-spacing:.06em;margin:0 0 8px}
input[type=email],input[type=password],.searchbar input{width:100%;font:inherit;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:10px;background:var(--paper);margin-bottom:16px}
.kv{display:grid;grid-template-columns:max-content 1fr;gap:10px 18px;margin:0}.kv dt{font:600 .74rem/1.6 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink2)}.kv dd{margin:0}
.ticks{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.ticks li{padding:9px 0 9px 32px;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--rule);position:relative}.ticks li:before{content:"✓";position:absolute;left:4px;top:7px;color:var(--q2);font-weight:700}
.boxes{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.boxes li{padding:9px 0 9px 32px;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--rule);position:relative}.boxes li:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:2px;top:12px;width:16px;height:16px;border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:3px}
.caltile{width:150px;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 18px 30px -18px rgba(23,33,58,.5);text-align:center;flex:none}.caltile .m{background:var(--c);color:#fff;font:600 .9rem/1 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;padding:10px}.caltile .d{font:500 5rem/1.1 "Newsreader",serif;padding:4px 0 8px}
.dhead{display:flex;gap:30px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px}
.count{font:600 .82rem/1 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;background:var(--red);color:#fff;border-radius:99px;padding:8px 12px;display:inline-block}
.notice{background:#fff3ef;border:1px solid #f0c3b6;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px}
.lockp{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:16px;padding:34px;max-width:760px;background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg,transparent 0 14px,rgba(23,33,58,.03) 14px 28px)}
.lockp h2{font-size:1.7rem;margin-bottom:10px}
.steps{list-style:none;counter-reset:s;margin:28px 0 0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px}.steps li{counter-increment:s;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:14px;padding:22px}.steps li:before{content:counter(s,decimal-leading-zero);display:block;font:500 2.6rem/1 "Newsreader",serif;color:var(--q4);margin-bottom:12px}.steps p{color:var(--ink2);margin:8px 0 0;font-size:.96rem}
.tscroll{overflow-x:auto}.fig{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;font-size:.97rem}
.fig th{text-align:left;font:600 .72rem/1.2 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:12px 16px}.fig td{padding:12px 16px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}.fig td:not(:first-child){font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.9rem}.fig tr:nth-child(even) td{background:#faf7f0}
.notes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}.note{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-left:5px solid var(--q3);border-radius:10px;padding:20px}.note h3{margin:10px 0 8px;font-size:1.2rem}
.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}
.doc{display:block;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}.doc:hover{border-color:var(--ink);color:var(--ink)}.doc b{display:block;font:500 1.15rem/1.25 "Newsreader",serif;margin:10px 0 4px}.doc span.s{color:var(--ink2);font-size:.92rem}
.track{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:0;margin:8px 0 0;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--rule)}.track>div{padding:18px;background:var(--card);border-top:6px solid var(--c);opacity:.6}.track>div+div{border-left:1px solid var(--rule)}.track .now{opacity:1;background:#fff}.track b{display:block;font:500 1.15rem/1.2 "Newsreader",serif;margin:6px 0}.track small{font:600 .68rem/1 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--c)}.track p{margin:0;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--ink2)}
.ccard{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#17213a,#2c3b63);color:#fff;border-radius:18px;padding:26px 28px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:220px}.ccard:after{content:"";position:absolute;right:-60px;top:-60px;width:220px;height:220px;border-radius:50%;border:26px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
.ccard small{font:600 .7rem/1 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#f0b59f}.ccard h2{color:#fff;font-size:2rem;margin:12px 0 6px}.ccard .cn{font:500 1rem/1 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;margin-top:30px;color:#c9cfdd}
.searchbar{display:flex;gap:10px;max-width:640px;margin-top:22px}.searchbar input{margin:0}
.hit{display:block;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}.hit b{font:500 1.2rem "Newsreader",serif}.hit p{margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--ink2);font-size:.95rem}.hit:hover b{color:var(--q4)}
.foot{background:var(--ink);color:#b8c0d4;padding:56px 0 30px;font-size:.95rem}.foot a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none}.foot a:hover{text-decoration:underline;color:#fff}.foot h4{color:#fff;font:600 .74rem/1 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px}
.foot ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.foot li{margin:8px 0}.fg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:36px}.fb{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px}.fb b{color:#fff;font:500 1.3rem "Newsreader",serif}
.disc{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:40px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid #2c3858;font:500 .74rem/1.5 "IBM Plex Mono",monospace;color:#8f99b3}
@media (max-width:1100px){.svcs{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.ppl{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}.tiles{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.alm{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.ppl.big{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}
@media (max-width:860px){.hero .g,.dg,.band .w{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{padding-top:30px}.qband,.track{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.inds,.nlist,.notes,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}.alm{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.fg{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
 .tiles{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.ppl,.ppl.big{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.axis,.krow{grid-template-columns:1fr 90px}.axis .sc,.krow .bar{grid-column:1/-1;order:3}.axis>span:first-child{display:none}.top .hm,.top input{display:none}.nav ul{gap:0}.nav ul a{padding:6px 8px;font-size:.92rem}.hdr .w{padding-bottom:18px}.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}.top .fict{font-size:.66rem}}
@media (max-width:860px){.hero .g{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;align-items:stretch}.hero .g>div:first-child{display:contents}.hero .kick{order:1}.hero h1{order:2}.dialwrap{order:3;margin:26px 0 0}.legend{order:4}.hero .lede{order:5}.office{order:6}.hero .cta{order:7}}
@media (max-width:520px){.top .w{flex-wrap:nowrap;min-height:36px}.top .fict{font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.04em}.top .tr a{font-size:.8rem;white-space:nowrap}.top .tr a+a{display:none}.svcs,.alm,.qband,.track,.tiles{grid-template-columns:1fr}.w{padding:0 18px}h1{font-size:2.1rem}.nav .btn{display:none}.office{flex-direction:column}.office div{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}.dhead{flex-direction:column;align-items:start}}
</style></head><body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<div class="top"><div class="w"><span class="fict">FICTIONAL CPA FIRM · RAYTHA EXAMPLE SITE</span><div class="tr">{% if CurrentUser.IsAuthenticated %}<span class="hm">Signed in as <b>{{ CurrentUser.FirstName }}</b></span><a href="{{ PathBase }}/client-portal">Client portal</a><a href="{{ PathBase }}/account/logout">Sign out</a>{% else %}<a href="{{ PathBase }}/account/login?returnUrl=/client-portal">Client portal sign-in</a><a class="hm" href="{{ PathBase }}/account/login?returnUrl=/staff-room">Staff</a>{% endif %}<form action="{{ PathBase }}/search" role="search"><input name="q" aria-label="Search the site" placeholder="Search deadlines, services, notes…"></form></div></div></div>
<header class="hdr"><div class="w"><a class="brand" href="{{ PathBase }}/"><svg width="44" height="44" viewBox="0 0 44 44" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="22" cy="22" r="21" fill="#17213a"/><path d="M23.3 7.1 A15 15 0 0 1 36.9 20.7" stroke="#2c6e74" stroke-width="6" fill="none"/><path d="M36.9 23.3 A15 15 0 0 1 23.3 36.9" stroke="#5f8a3a" stroke-width="6" fill="none"/><path d="M20.7 36.9 A15 15 0 0 1 7.1 23.3" stroke="#c99227" stroke-width="6" fill="none"/><path d="M7.1 20.7 A15 15 0 0 1 20.7 7.1" stroke="#b4502e" stroke-width="6" fill="none"/><path d="M22 22 L31 13" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="22" cy="22" r="3" fill="#fff"/></svg><span><b>Tellmarsh <i>&amp;</i> Penhallow</b><small>CPAs · Merrow Bend · since 1987</small></span></a>
<nav class="nav" aria-label="Main"><ul>{%- assign menu = get_main_menu() -%}{% for mi in menu.MenuItems %}<li><a href="{{ mi.Url }}">{{ mi.Label }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul><a class="btn sm" href="{{ PathBase }}/new-clients">New clients</a></nav></div></header>
<main id="main">{% renderbody %}</main>
<footer class="foot"><div class="w"><div class="fg"><div><div class="fb"><svg width="44" height="44" viewBox="0 0 44 44" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="22" cy="22" r="21" fill="#17213a"/><path d="M23.3 7.1 A15 15 0 0 1 36.9 20.7" stroke="#2c6e74" stroke-width="6" fill="none"/><path d="M36.9 23.3 A15 15 0 0 1 23.3 36.9" stroke="#5f8a3a" stroke-width="6" fill="none"/><path d="M20.7 36.9 A15 15 0 0 1 7.1 23.3" stroke="#c99227" stroke-width="6" fill="none"/><path d="M7.1 20.7 A15 15 0 0 1 20.7 7.1" stroke="#b4502e" stroke-width="6" fill="none"/><path d="M22 22 L31 13" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="22" cy="22" r="3" fill="#fff"/></svg><b>Tellmarsh &amp; Penhallow CPAs</b></div><p>14 Wharf Street, Merrow Bend (fictional). Main line (555) 017-4400. Weekdays 8:30 to 5; February to April also Saturdays 9 to 1. The firm, its people, clients and figures are fictional; this is a Raytha example site.</p></div>
<div><h4>Work with us</h4><ul><li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/services">Services</a></li><li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/fees">Fees</a></li><li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/who-we-serve">Who we serve</a></li><li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/people">People</a></li></ul></div>
